  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Authentication and account state",
      "items": [
        "Access JWTs carry user id + tokenVersion; middleware verifies both and rejects deactivated/deleted users — authenticationMiddleware (Backend/src/middleware/authMiddleware.js:4-30).",
        "Refresh tokens are random, bcrypt-hashed database records; rotation is transactional — issueTokens (Backend/src/utils/generateTokens.js:4-13), refreshToken (Backend/src/controllers/authController.js:411-445).",
        "Deactivation invalidates refresh tokens/devices; reactivation uses a signed 10-minute challenge — deactivate/reactivate (Backend/src/controllers/accountController.js:56-86; Backend/src/controllers/authController.js:277-305)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Discover eligibility",
      "items": [
        "Completed onboarding is mandatory; candidate SQL excludes self, prior actions, existing matches, blocks, and non-active accounts — getFeed (Backend/src/controllers/discoverController.js:238-354).",
        "Reciprocal age, gender, and distance rules plus profile completeness are compiled into SQL — discoverEligibilityPolicy (Backend/src/services/discoverEligibilityPolicy.js:101-237)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Compatibility and LOCAL ranking",
      "items": [
        "Compatibility uses weighted interests, goals, communication, languages, city, and lifestyle factors — scoreCompatibility (Backend/src/services/compatibilityScoringService.js:81-128).",
        "AI Matches ranks the complete eligible set before pagination and returns provider LOCAL — getFeed (Backend/src/controllers/discoverController.js:393-485).",
        "localAiMatch/rankCandidates are deterministic in-process functions; no remote model call is present — Backend/src/services/aiMatchProvider.js:38-65."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Relationship and messaging invariants",
      "items": [
        "A reciprocal like/super-like creates Match and direct Conversation in one transaction — swipe (Backend/src/controllers/discoverController.js:545-592).",
        "Conversation access requires an active match, active completed profiles, and no block — conversationAccess (Backend/src/services/conversationAccessService.js:19-44).",
        "Messages persist before Socket.IO events and notification creation — send (Backend/src/controllers/messageController.js:134-161)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Realtime and notification delivery",
      "items": [
        "Socket.IO shares the HTTP server, verifies JWT/tokenVersion, and keeps presence in an in-process connection map — attachRealtimeServer (Backend/src/realtime/realtimeHub.js:76-160).",
        "Notification records are preference/mute aware; push delivery records credentials_required when FCM is not configured — notificationService (Backend/src/services/notificationService.js:26-82)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "OTP and deletion",
      "items": [
        "OTPs are bcrypt-hashed, expire after 10 minutes, allow five attempts, and are purpose-bound — createOtp/verifyOtp (Backend/src/services/otpService.js:43-139).",
        "OTP-confirmed deletion writes DeletedUsers, removes relationship/profile state, scrubs messages, anonymizes User, and increments tokenVersion — ImmediateAccountDeletionService.execute (Backend/src/services/immediateAccountDeletionService.js:11-132)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "External integration state",
      "items": [
        "Implemented: Google ID-token verification, FCM HTTP v1, Twilio SMS, SMTP email, and Razorpay payments.",
        "Tracked defaults: Google is skip-for-now; Firebase, Twilio/SMS, SMTP, and Razorpay credentials are blank — Backend/.env.example:53-85.",
        "Runtime deployment activation is unknown because secrets are not committed; the diagram does not claim these providers are active."
      ]
    }
  ]
